&#x27;font-size:15px&#x27;&gt;0. Prepare&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Write every label one way, so equal things become exactly equal:&lt;br&gt;• names: katakana, no spaces, family + given joined; copies without dakuten, as it sounds (サトー = サトウ), last 3 sounds, first letter&lt;br&gt;• address: prefecture dropped; 丁目・番地・号 become hyphens; building and room dropped&lt;br&gt;• postcode: digits only, and its first 3 digits as the area&lt;br&gt;• each record marked person or company" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="996" width="520" height="184" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v103" value="" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#cccccc;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1370" y="996" width="1" height="184" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v104" value="&lt;b style=&#x27;font-size:13px&#x27;&gt;Cost&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Read each letter once per copy:&lt;br&gt;N × Σ L&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1M records: &lt;b&gt;5.2 s&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1380" y="996" width="400" height="184" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v105" value="#" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1000" width="28" height="27" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v106" value="name" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=He